                                                "sense_id": "d64caf06-6dae-3538-8e6f-8bcae88bc4a2",
                                                "text": "The four last brewings, in which the quantity of yeast added was smaller than in the six first, took place during the month of May, when the heat is apt to make the fermentation run to excess."
